#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556008"
msgid "Khh……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556020"
msgid "Rrr……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556032"
msgid "Tch……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556044"
msgid "…………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556324"
msgid "Could it be…? Does #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF also have\nthat skill #C236196003BB#CDEF has―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556728"
msgid "…#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said she will―――\nProtect #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF from #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557820"
msgid "I like either one, by the way.\n…ahem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558744"
msgid "…………oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560488"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's body dips slightly.\nShe looks like a figure skater\nready to start off with a dash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560744"
msgid "And what does she mean by \"kill in one blow,\" anyway?\nIs that a metaphor, or―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561160"
msgid "Another #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561336"
msgid "Without #C236196003Archer#CDEF, I'm certain I would've been skewered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561668"
msgid "That's right. You're a sharp one.\nLike just now. You sensed my ambush\nbefore it happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562272"
msgid "………wha―huh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562472"
msgid "Your arm of steel took my blow with ease.\nYour #RUBS heart#RUBEmind#REND of steel put your Master first.\nYour hawk #RUBSvisage#RUBEface#REND pierces though me――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562804"
msgid "Ahhh. At last, I've found my true calling…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562856"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF! I want to fall in love with you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563152"
msgid "Don't you remember?\nI mean, you don't even hate #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563344"
msgid "N-nonsense!\nI'm a man of integrity.\nAnd you! Quiet down, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563412"
msgid "……oops."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563904"
msgid "Rrr……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564220"
msgid "Could it be…? Does #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF also have\nthat skill #C236196003BB#CDEF has―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564528"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "564820"
msgid "Get away, Archer!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "564844"
msgid "Save me, Archer!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "564868"
msgid "Go to hell, Archer!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565056"
msgid "…it's total nonsense.\nI 100% can't understand my own train of thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565132"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF silently takes a step towards the calm #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566416"
msgid "Hee hee… I've been robbed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567244"
msgid "You're too late……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567272"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's body dips slightly.\nShe looks like a figure skater\nready to start off with a dash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567524"
msgid "What……!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567968"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568100"
msgid "―――There!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568116"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568128"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's silhouette dances within the thick fog."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569208"
msgid "Hmph. I'm not impressed by your surprise attack,\nbut that blow was excellent.\nVery well. Give us your name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569320"
msgid "Her malevolence is profound…\nShe ambushed us to get our attention.\nShe's underestimating us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569428"
msgid "Tell us your name.\nEven an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF must know what manners are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570080"
msgid "Another #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570256"
msgid "Without #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, I'm certain I would've been skewered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570800"
msgid "It's obvious.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nI know everything about you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570880"
msgid "And you're going to know everything about me.\nWe're going to become one. Become unable\nto live without me. Now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571256"
msgid "I actually wanted to come greet you\nsooner, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571792"
msgid "Depending on what happens, #C236196003BB#CDEF may even\ndelete you. But I'm here. I'll protect\nyou from #C236196003BB#CDEF. So―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572256"
msgid "Yes, or no?\nMy answer is―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "572288"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "572296"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573168"
msgid "I can satisfy you with all kinds of pleasures―\nin a cradle filled with happiness."
msgstr ""

